    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "A stunning 3  bedroom bungalow situated at 1 Corrib View, Cornamona, Co. Galway. This property extends to circa 1259 sq ft. and sits on a site of circa 0.67 acres. This property is in pristine condition throughout. Cornamona is a picturesque village in what is known as Joyce country and is situated close to the northern shore of Lough Corrib. Mount Gable forms an impressive backdrop. The area is renowned for its angling and hill walking  and an ideal base to explore the nearby beauty of Connemara. It is only 300 metres from the pier and swimming area. It is located approximately 500m from Cornamona village, 14km from Cong, 21km from Leenane and 55km from Galway.  Cornamona village has a shop, pub, playground, community centre, school, church, with many restaurants only a short drive away. \r\n\r\nSome of its many features include timber flooring in hallway, open plan kitchen/dining/living room, fully fitted kitchen, utility with built in units, fireplace  in living room, timber floors and built in wardrobes in all bedrooms, fully tiled bathroom and ensuite, oil fired central heating, white pvc double glazed windows, patio area, front and rear gardens, garden shed, mature trees at side and rear of property, gravelled driveway with ample parking.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises of Entrance Porch, Hallway, Kitchen/Dining/living Room, Utility Room, Living Room, 3 Bedrooms, 1 Ensuite, 1 Bathroom.\r\n\r\nThis property is an ideal family home, holiday home or investment opportunity and viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Porch - 1.76m x 1.48m \r\nTimber flooring, 1 radiator.\r\n\r\nHallway - 4.167m x 1.067m \r\nTimber flooring, 1 radiator.\r\n\r\nCloset - Hallway - 1.0m x 1.0m \r\n\r\n\r\nLiving Room - 6.918m x 4.9m \r\nOpen plan, fireplace with cast iron and tImber surround, timber flooring, 1 radiator.\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Area - 4.53m x 4.03m \r\nFully fitted kitchen, integrated oven, hob, dishwasher.  American style fridge freezer,  patio door to side of house, timber flooring,           1 radiator.\r\n\r\nUtility Room - 2.953m x 2.193m \r\nFitted units, sink,  plumbed for washing machine & dryer, tiled flooring.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 (Master) - 4.172m x 3.47m \r\nBuilt-in wardrobes, timber flooring, 1 radiator.\r\n\r\nEnsuite - 2.116m x 0.969m \r\nFully tiled, wc., wash hand basin, electric shower, 1 radiator.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.737m x 3.078m \r\nBuilt-in wardrobes, timber flooring, 1 radiator.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 3.57m x 3.57m \r\nBuilt-in wardrobes, timber flooring, 1 radiator.\r\n\r\nMain Bathroom - 2.387m x 2.295m \r\nFully tiled, wc., wash hand basin with vanity unit, wheelchair accessible shower, 1 radiator.\r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "A stunning 3 bedroom bungalow. Extends to circa 1259 sq ft.\r\nSits on a site of circa 0.67 acres.\r\nTimber flooring in hallway.\r\nFully fitted kitchen.\r\nFireplace  in living room.\r\nTimber floors and built in wardrobes in bedrooms.\r\nFully tiled bathroom and ensuite.\r\nOil fired central heating. White pvc double glazed windows.\r\nPatio area. Front and rear gardens with garden shed.\r\nGravelled driveway.  Ample parking."
